OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water worst for supply
OL,4,A- how do the rest fare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water is the worst in the
OL,7,Findustry for supply interruptions, a
OL,8,Fnew report says, while Southern Water
OL,9,Fand Thames Water perform badly on
OL,10,Fenvironment.
OL,12,FA new report from joint water
OL,13,Fregulators Ofwat, the Drinking Water
OL,14,FInspectorate, the Environment Agency,
OL,15,Fand National Resources Wales, has been
OL,16,Freleased to give a single view on
OL,17,Fperformance.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
