OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water worst for supply
OL,4,A- how do the rest fare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report found Southern Water and
OL,7,FThames Water saw a combined 765
OL,8,Fpollution incidents in 2025, while
OL,9,FSouth East Water saw its average
OL,10,Fminutes of supply lost per property it
OL,11,Fserves increase sixfold compared to
OL,12,F2024.
OL,14,FSpokespeople for the water companies
OL,15,Fsay they had made progress on
OL,16,Fperformance.
